# Territory Forge (CR 607.2a, 613.1f): cast on turn 3, its enters trigger exiles Bot2's Mana Vault and it has the Vault's activated ability, "{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}",
# as its own: it is an artifact (no summoning sickness), so Bot1 taps it at once for {C}{C}{C}. It does not have the Vault's triggered
# upkeep damage, nor its static ability of not untapping (they are not activated abilities): it untaps in Bot1's turn-five untap step.

